.TH "MKDOCS GET-DEPS" "1" "2026-11-16" "1.6.1" "mkdocs get-deps Manual"
.SH NAME
mkdocs\-get-deps \- Show required PyPI packages inferred from...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mkdocs get-deps
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show required PyPI packages inferred from plugins in mkdocs.yml.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v,\fP \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-config\-file FILENAME
Provide a specific MkDocs config. This can be a file name, or '-' to read from stdin.
.TP
\fB\-p,\fP \-\-projects\-file TEXT
URL or local path of the registry file that declares all known MkDocs-related projects.
